{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If it is known that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c29788cfd8bf2df619598c3e83b62587ee18bd9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(a)+\\log_2(b) \\ge 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />, then the least value that can be taken on by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/3/bd38ac454d316c289a21385d9aec47d7dbb59080.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2\\sqrt{6}\\quad \\text{(B) } 6\\quad \\text{(C) } 8\\sqrt{2}\\quad \\text{(D) } 16\\quad \\text{(E) none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"408\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We use the logarithm property of addition:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/8/dc80b7338a837215902c9a7d182aa11a8be273ad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\log_2(a)+\\log_2(b) \\ge 6 &amp;= \\log_2(ab) \\ge 6\\\\ &amp;\\Rightarrow 2^{log_2(ab)} \\ge 2^6\\\\ &amp;= ab \\ge 64 \\end{align*}\" width=\"287\" height=\"70\" />\nDue to the Quadratic <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Optimization\" title=\"Optimization\">Optimization</a> or the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AM-GM_Inequality\" title=\"AM-GM Inequality\">AM-GM Inequality</a>, the least value is obtained when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/397fd7b1f33bdbf6ee27a83d1bcee42d222cb331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />.\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/4/444448347509902c473b74950797bce91d750b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b = 8 \\Rightarrow a + b = \\boxed{(D)16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"226\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Pro